[{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3085412744","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/108722#issuecomment-3085412744","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/108722","id":3085412744,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6356mI","user":{"login":"Calinou","id":180032,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE4MDAzMg==","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/180032?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou","html_url":"https://github.com/Calinou","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-07-17T20:42:59Z","updated_at":"2025-07-17T20:58:24Z","body":"I can confirm this on f92f1ce9c (Linux, NVIDIA). This is also reproducible on all versions between 4.0 and 4.4.1.stable, although the FXAA appearance between 4.4.1.stable and 4.5.beta differs as a consequence of https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/89582.\n\nIn the comparison below, the post-scaling image comes directly from Godot, while the pre-scaling image was rendered by using a smaller window size, `1.0` render scale, and 4× bilinear upscaling in GIMP. Ignore the slight differences in ground color, it's likely caused by the browser/color profile (as I don't see any when viewing the images in Gwenview).\n\n**Testing project:** [3d_scaling_with_screen_space_aa_2.zip](https://github.com/user-attachments/files/21304580/3d_scaling_with_screen_space_aa_2.zip)\nSame as OP's MRP, but with a camera added for easier comparison.\n\n### No AA\n\nPost-scaling (`master`) | Pre-scaling (how it should be)\n-|-\n<img width=\"1152\" height=\"648\" alt=\"Image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/3566f4d3-7e4a-495b-8305-60668c499b7f\" /> | <img width=\"1152\" height=\"648\" alt=\"Image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/6acac986-dd5e-4141-9ba8-c168c4616a98\" />\n\n### FXAA\n\nPost-scaling (`master`) | Pre-scaling (how it should be)\n-|-\n<img width=\"1152\" height=\"648\" alt=\"Image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/196550be-d52f-4c59-b134-cba45734d3e4\" /> | <img width=\"1152\" height=\"648\" alt=\"Image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/fdd6d605-8f8b-4c31-bc88-0b51bd48af5f\" />\n\n### SMAA\n\nPost-scaling (`master`) | Pre-scaling (how it should be)\n-|-\n<img width=\"1152\" height=\"648\" alt=\"Image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/261fdf71-330e-4c8c-8fa4-16b7b8e43e27\" /> | <img width=\"1152\" height=\"648\" alt=\"Image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/a7cd9b50-81a2-4f3f-8262-0b8b5c6e931c\" />\n\n\n\n","author_association":"MEMBER","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3085412744/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":1},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3088168133","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/108722#issuecomment-3088168133","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/108722","id":3088168133,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc64EbTF","user":{"login":"mrjustaguy","id":50302479,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjUwMzAyNDc5","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/50302479?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.githu